{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19546","headline":"上元日听太清宫步虚 · 张仲素","name":"上元日听太清宫步虚","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仙客开金籙，元辰会玉京。\n灵歌宾紫府，雅韵出层城。\n磬杂音徐彻，风飘响更清。\n纡余空外尽，断续听中生。\n舞鹤纷将集，流云住未行。\n谁知九陌上，尘俗仰遗声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张仲素","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19546.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19546","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}